            "text": "Architecture / attack-surface mapping — No issue identified: Repository-wide runtime and tooling boundary map\n\nMapped `lib/`, Supabase SQL/migrations and Edge Function, Android packaging, tests, diagnostics, docs/state, design-reference, and generated caches; recorded runtime vs non-runtime boundaries and authoritative Supabase trust boundary in the shared threat model and notes."
