          "ruleIndex": 5,
          "kind": "pass",
          "level": "none",
          "message": {
            "text": "Hardcoded credentials / secret exposure — Ruled out: Product source, manifests, lockfiles, and local configuration secrets scan\n\nThe credential-bearing add/delete commits are agent-host checkpoint commits reachable only from `refs/agents/<id>/checkpoints/*`; they are not ancestors of `HEAD` and no local branch, remote-tracking ref, or tag contains them. The current QA account file is untracked and ignored. Available Git metadata therefore rules out project/shared repository exposure despite the accounts being plausible hosted-Supabase QA accounts."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "logicalLocations": [
                {
                  "fullyQualifiedName": "Product source, manifests, lockfiles, and local configuration secrets scan"
