          "ruleIndex": 7,
          "kind": "notApplicable",
          "level": "none",
          "message": {
            "text": "Command injection, XXE, path traversal, and SSRF surface mapping — Not applicable: Runtime Dart process, XML, filesystem, and outbound-request surfaces\n\nNo process/shell execution, XML parser, or native filesystem path sink was found in runtime Dart code. The only direct `http` call is in `private_media_repository.dart`, where the destination is derived from the operator-configured Supabase REST base URL plus a fixed Edge Function path; media file handling is tracked separately."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "logicalLocations": [
                {
                  "fullyQualifiedName": "Runtime Dart process, XML, filesystem, and outbound-request surfaces"
                }
